bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    native_entry_closure_preclosed_walk_omits_mcdc_static_probe_owner_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 FIXED (needs Stage 2 redeploy). --entry-closure native builds under SIMPLE_MCDC_MODE=on (the runner's fail-closed default) link-fail with undefined lib.nogc_sync_mut.mcdc.static_probe.mcdc_static_probe_configure_bytes whenever the authored closure lacks the owner: MIR emits the entry configure call, but the CLI walk that publishes the frozen preclosed request (closure_walks=0) follows authored imports only and the pipeline scan that adds the synthetic edge never runs. All native doctests hit it (run 16 kind 2: channel.spl 4/4 errors). Fix: native_build_mcdc_closure_spec_v1 + push on the entry in _native_build_entry_closure."

